1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,171
Can your four year old read this? Let's try!

2
00:00:04,071 --> 00:00:06,401
Splat! Rocco lands in the mud.

3
00:00:07,301 --> 00:00:10,330
He tries again. Bounce! A bit higher!

4
00:00:11,230 --> 00:00:12,776
He flies high up in the sky!

5
00:00:13,676 --> 00:00:21,268
Every page has one big picture to color, and one short sentence in big, easy letters. First they color it, then they read it!

6
00:00:22,168 --> 00:00:26,751
Rocco the Little Monster Truck. Ages three to six. Link in bio!

